{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43020","headline":"晚春宴 · 韦道逊","name":"晚春宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日斜宾馆晚，春轻麦候初。\n帘暄巢幕燕，池跃戏莲鱼。\n石声随流响，桐影傍岩疎。\n谁能千里外，独寄八行书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦道逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}